// 4.31.20 · date and time in 24 hours (0000–2359), never AM/PM: the browser's datetime-local box follows the computer's clock format, so on a
// 12-hour Windows it asked for AM/PM. This field is a date box plus a time box typed as the master sends it ("1830", "18:30", "6:05").
